body:
## What

For a given claim, list every paper in the library that supports or refutes it.

## Schema

```
name: "explain_evidence"
description: "For a given claim, list every paper in the library that supports or refutes it, with verbatim quotes."
inputSchema: {
  type: "object",
  properties: {
    claim: { type: "string" },
    max_papers: { type: "integer", default: 5, minimum: 1, maximum: 10 }
  },
  required: ["claim"]
}
annotations: { readOnlyHint: true, untrustedContentHint: true }
```

## Acceptance

- [ ] At least one paper is found for typical claims
- [ ] Each result has a quote and a stance (supporting / refuting / mentioning)
- [ ] Stance is calibrated (verified on 5 hand-labeled claims)
